{% Figure label="Accounts" caption="" ratio="16 / 10" /%}

## What shipped

Payments and Accounts shipped. The rest of the redesign (invoices, customers, bills) was designed but hadn’t been built when my contract ended, so I don’t have usage data. The company completed its fundraise and has since pivoted to a different venture.
